      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNEAU QUADRANT (7) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. MANILA PLUTO (8) stalked the lead from a low draw and fought on well to finish 3 lengths back in third (19.68) at this track in a Grade 6 over 340m. Expected to be in the finish again. TIMELESS PANAMA (1) out of the money last few starts but gets her best chance from the cherry. Last time finished last over 515m at Launceston beaten 11 lengths (30.46) behind Vista Yank in a Special conditions race on August 31. The form from her last run stacks up well. Better than last start and can bounce back. JAMELLA STORM (2) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
